WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.603
These are the years debt credit and family plans

00:00:03.642 --> 00:00:08.210
compound the fastest for better or worse Everything here

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.737
starts with the debt already carried then builds outward

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:14.750
to the account the roof and the family plan

00:00:14.789 --> 00:00:15.355
around it

00:00:21.217 --> 00:00:24.954
A credit card an appliance installment and money borrowed

00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:27.362
from a relative can feel like ten debts when

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:28.967
none of them are written down

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:38.188
A debt not on the list still grows Write

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.240
it down first
